1
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,560
If you dare to mess with the Liu family,

2
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:25,080
you, as my legal counsel,

3
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,720
will be fired today.

4
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,360
As long as I am the CEO of Lin Group,

5
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,400
she, as my legal counsel,

6
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,440
will not be fired.

7
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,600
In the eyes of some people,

8
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,040
you, me,

9
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,440
and your brother

10
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:21,400
are just pawns.

11
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,480
You are used when needed,

12
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:24,960
and can be abandoned

13
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:26,840
or sacrificed

14
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,520
when not needed

15
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,720
or threatening.

16
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,280
Enough.

17
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,360
I don't want to hear your big talk.

18
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:33,840
I just want to know

19
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,840
if you sent

20
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:36,440
this anonymous email.

21
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:38,200
Did you know

22
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,400
Wen Shiyi had this trick up her sleeve?

23
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,160
Did you stir up trouble between me and Lin Jiming

24
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:44,600
just to wait until today,

25
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,240
until I had nowhere to turn and came to you?

26
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,080
Ms. Liu,

27
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,720
you're very smart.

28
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,840
But your imagination

29
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,760
could be even more creative.

30
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,320
If I sent it,

31
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,240
why would I be anonymous?

32
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,360
I could have just taken these things

33
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,520
and negotiated with you.

34
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,920
Wouldn't that be better?

35
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,520
What's the point

36
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:04,080
of me being anonymous,

37
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:05,960
other than to alert you,

38
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,400
making you rush into my office

39
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,080
like you did today?

40
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,840
Then how do you explain all this?

41
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,200
How do you

42
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,800
seem to know everything?

43
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,680
Because I saw through Wen's true nature

44
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,840
long before you did.

45
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,040
And because

46
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:26,400
I won't let myself

47
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:27,760
end up like you

48
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,880
or your brother,

49
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,680
just another pawn she discards.

50
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:32,560
To protect yourself,

51
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,840
you must know your opponent inside out,

52
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,680
including her tactics.

53
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,680
Using others' weaknesses

54
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,800
and past grievances to eliminate rivals.

55
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,160
This is her classic move.

56
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,000
Targeting your brother,

57
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,120
it was expected.

58
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,280
Self-preservation.

59
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,920
Your goal is just to protect yourself?

60
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,320
I don't believe you.

61
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,760
Everything you do

62
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,160
is aggressive.

63
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,240
The best way to protect yourself

64
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:06,160
is to make the people who threaten you disappear.

65
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:06,840
Isn't that right?

66
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,600
Ms. Liu,

67
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:17,120
we now have a common enemy.

68
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:20,120
Wen Poetic not only wants to destroy your family's peace,

69
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,800
but also is hindering me.

70
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,680
More importantly,

71
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,240
she thinks we are both

72
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,400
soft targets that can be easily manipulated.

73
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:36,720
And then?

74
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,920
After using me to take down Wen Poetic,

75
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:43,320
is the next target

76
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,240
my family?

77
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,080
Do you

78
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,960
have something

79
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,600
on me?

80
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,400
To be honest,

81
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:53,520
I do.

82
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,280
About your brother,

83
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,720
and the South City land,

84
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:59,400
I know as much as Wen Shiyi.

85
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,440
But

86
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:01,640
I'm not like her.

87
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,680
I want to remove obstacles

88
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,600
and stand firmly,

89
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,760
not to make endless enemies.

90
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,080
A fallen Wen Shiyi

91
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,920
is the most valuable to me,

92
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:13,160
not a Lin Group with countless enemies

93
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,840
with countless enemies.

94
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,120
Keeping your Liu family safe

95
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:19,000
is only beneficial for me

96
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,480
to take over the Lin family's project

97
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,560
in the future.

98
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,000
This is a simple test of interests.

99
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:42,640
Fine.

100
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,000
Guan Tiantian,

101
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,520
I'll trust you this time,

102
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,600
not because of your character,

103
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,600
but

104
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,640
your intelligence

105
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,320
and judgment of interests.

106
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,600
I hope

107
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:54,920
you're right.

108
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,160
I won't let you down.

109
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,680
Now I need you to use your auditing power

110
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,360
to investigate the abnormal capital flow

111
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,720
of the UK subsidiary three years ago.

112
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:06,960
I think

113
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,280
that's her weakness.

114
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,120
Guan Tiantian,

115
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:14,560
sometimes,

116
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,840
I really admire you.

117
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:19,000
If we met under different circumstances,

118
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,760
we might have become good friends.

119
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,200
It's not too late now.

120
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,400
Pleasure working with you.

121
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,360
The alliance

122
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,360
was officially formed at this moment

123
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,360
based on fear,

124
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,760
interests,

125
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,520
was officially formed.

126
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,240
Xiaoyu,

127
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,680
you're here.

128
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,040
Mom,

129
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,160
this is Lawyer Guan,

130
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,400
my friend.

131
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,600
Lawyer Guan,

132
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:34,840
you look

133
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,920
just like Xiaoyu.

134
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:48,240
I heard you're not feeling well,

135
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,560
so I came to see you.

136
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:50,920
Auntie,

137
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,120
are you feeling any better?

138
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,920
It's just an old problem.

139
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:56,600
Well,

140
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,880
get some rest.

141
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,880
If there's anything you want to eat,

142
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,320
just let me know, and I'll get it for you.

143
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,200
Ah,

144
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,440
that's alright.

145
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,520
Your work is more important.

146
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,520
Go ahead.

147
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,280
Thank you for visiting my mom.

148
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:20,120
She's been in a daze lately.

149
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,960
But as soon as she's awake,

150
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,840
she keeps talking about Yu.

151
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,920
She will get better.

152
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,080
How about you?

153
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,320
How are you doing lately?

154
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,240
You seem to have something on your mind.

155
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,720
It's nothing serious.

156
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:10,960
Anyway,

157
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,400
safety comes first.

158
00:08:13,200 --> 00:08:14,160
After all,

159
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,440
you are my friend.

160
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,520
OK.

161
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,560
By the way,

162
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,720
I have stopped

163
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,800
handling the case of Bai Qiang.

164
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,440
The person we sent to the UK reported back that

165
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,200
the death certificate of Gu Qingyu is indeed true.

166
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,120
But there's no record of her cremation

167
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,960
in the hospital.

168
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:15,120
Guan Yu knows I like sculptures.

169
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,320
That's really thoughtful.

170
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,320
Know yourself and your opponent,

171
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,000
and you'll always be victorious.

172
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,560
The sense of fragmentation and alienation

173
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,760
is portrayed so realistically.

174
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,040
She shows an unusual avoidance

175
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,920
towards her family,

176
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:25,800
the past,

177
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,320
and accidents,

178
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,120
and even

179
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,600
physiological disgust.

180
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,840
You're not here to climb the social ladder,

181
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:41,440
but to collect debts.

182
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,080
Zhan Shan,

183
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,280
is it really Gu Qingyu?

184
00:09:47,800 --> 00:09:49,200
She's back.

185
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,800
What you need is all here.

186
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,520
I made a backup of the original

187
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,360
and hid it away.

188
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,560
By the way,

189
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,720
Wen Shiyi

190
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,920
urged me to issue the final report yesterday.

191
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:15,960
Hold her off.

192
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,760
We need time

193
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,800
to make the evidence work.

194
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,080
Then

195
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,320
what about my brother?

196
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,480
As long as Wen Shiyi falls,

197
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:25,000
the things in the anonymous email

198
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,320
will have no source.

199
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,600
When necessary,

200
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,840
we can use it

201
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,840
to counter Wen's frame-up.

202
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:32,920
Yes.

203
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:40,000
Mr. Wen.

204
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:03,080
I knew it.

205
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,520
Tell me.

206
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,680
She looked into the flow of funds

207
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:08,000
from the UK subsidiary,

208
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,120
and also

209
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,680
Zhou Qi's whereabouts after he left.

210
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,000
But

211
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,440
there's no record in the system.

212
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,600
She's not here to check the accounts,

213
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:18,120
but to dig up the past.

214
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,640
But Zhou Qi

215
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:21,560
immigrated to South America three years ago.

216
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,960
She shouldn't find anything.

217
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:24,960
What if she does?

218
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,000
She must disappear.

219
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:28,280
Zhan Shan,

220
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:30,000
you go handle it personally.

221
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,080
Zhan Shan

222
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:44,240
Whether Jiming can hold his position

223
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,440
depends on

224
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,680
how ruthless we are.

225
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:51,920
Yes.
